### 1. Where Generators Are Already Used in Your App

Look at [`app/db/session.py`](file:///home/pravi/Desktop/test_src/app/db/session.py):

```python
def get_db() -> Generator[Session, None, None]:
    db = SessionLocal()
    try:
        yield db         # <-- 1. Generates/yields database session to FastAPI
    finally:
        db.close()       # <-- 2. Resumes after request finishes to cleanly close connection
```
FastAPI uses this generator with `Depends(get_db)` to manage resource lifecycles (open on entry, close on exit).

